WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.816
What drives our impact on

2
00:00:01.816 --> 00:00:02.816
the planet?

3
00:00:02.816 --> 00:00:03.855
In 1971,

4
00:00:03.855 --> 00:00:07.246
one equation tried to answer.

5
00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.429
Impact equals population,

6
00:00:09.429 --> 00:00:10.658
times affluence,

7
00:00:10.658 --> 00:00:12.132
times technology.

8
00:00:12.132 --> 00:00:14.779
Ehrlich and Holdren set it

9
00:00:14.779 --> 00:00:16.550
out in 1971.

10
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.130
Impact grows with numbers and

11
00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.517
with consumption.

12
00:00:20.517 --> 00:00:22.566
Cleaner technology can bring it

13
00:00:22.566 --> 00:00:23.466
down.

14
00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:26.177
Link it to carrying capacity:

15
00:00:26.177 --> 00:00:28.626
the largest population an environment

16
00:00:28.626 --> 00:00:30.944
can support without damage.

17
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.856
Your turn.

18
00:00:32.856 --> 00:00:34.686
What does A stand for?
